  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:789850697904a8b3d71ee5c4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "菱亚马逊采用具有她个人风格的训练方式。\n然而，面对这种训练方式，\n摩耶重炮很快就吐露出自己的不满。",
      "source_fingerprint": "17b03c2ac5089d7c75b08816d480edbf89725b928b3bf62f2bcc9c3ef11eb5a6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f858e7ceb2f715c368fde72",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "菱亚马逊则向她提出忠告，\n说她因为直觉过于敏锐\n导致“察觉力”不够而放弃去思考。",
      "source_fingerprint": "49ec5433107c7ec99f5a37dba5eee4d09e80ad7b68aadffbd89a048dfd08c0e9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:358bc21c791f5bab32f4abe4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "好胜的摩耶重炮在听了她的话之后，\n才渐渐开始接受她为了帮自己获胜\n而进行的训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "beeada434643e5405ad6be31ff3a83d780dbfc9bdf98c05a4d8903b7ebc9bcf1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93829d6ed0f5501122da86a4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "青春的闪耀",
      "source_fingerprint": "108f899253f9ff732ac42fcd41e4e7dbdd4a8d21958842ea637b726dffdbaa69",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:277bfc3a8c1ded9eb771fb82",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "成田白仁不断拼命奔跑。\n然而她早就发现自己的身体\n快接近选手生涯的终点了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "704a72f33a5d60da3dc93c14808a7a18e2179a0e35db74a749a2315e9f3811a1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0d234013be2deda28009633",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是，无论伴随着多大的疼痛，\n为了满足自身的欲望，\n她只能选择继续跑下去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1bb590c7f70bec3adb42b396caf8f35a75d6595aafdae1d8da534ea3846f077",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11738155fd8cea17b15f8172",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "发现成田白仁本意的摩耶重炮，\n发誓要在她的“最后”来临前──",
      "source_fingerprint": "eeec703c9019d05f9f03bdb0250c38dcf4ce241edc862adbeeff17fe7dff8620",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d17909480ac08a14456dc49",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要用自己的表现让她感到兴奋，\n就像过去成田白仁让自己\n感到兴奋时那样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f363eae7ef0681c1a5c77e295130b6f35fd15b1c4f74d253ff8657d0b9aeb8b2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:495c80f3f90713fe253c2717",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迈向夕阳",
      "source_fingerprint": "db74a09112436c4d6799afabe61e67c3e24afdc5257c9b53682cdd7d64b3d7b4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:997f6da567b09d2ea10497b2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "来到夏季集训的摩耶重炮看到集训宿舍后，\n兴奋地喊着“好可爱”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7d63c9dd7982599385a4f54a0f4b60474431627210c329becb52521317352c9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7551c92a9e207b7b640b3956",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在训练员的提醒下，\n目标迈向成熟女性的\n“夏季集训”开始了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "765f46d920a4aa68e390a5bf556fc2fa46afaabe9d27ccb82910e4c8fa6a19f0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e704f39442ee3fd05d2c835",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训（第二年）开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e193ad94ba56712a8e92ed87a15587d1a6af48670f61e354efcb818a0837f0c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47f86ef09c7bfaf47de60656",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“夏季集训”再次来临。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d21d3be8b40cdf433fce2aff60b675efc6982813c135f00ecdf74edd8cef369a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75ca6851c50fd015e5b1fadc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "炎热的夏天开始了，\n摩耶重炮今年也要朝变成大人的目标迈进！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1d77c2416e85046377dcc8d6a4d16db2b0aab0c4405178f53ea091f7c912a19",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86d62fce7ebcec9ad1076d95",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训（第三年）开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eef37080660583492caac78b957b8f144bbb2896156162385fc6034f5649e4df",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2632272fc424f68954c0d2cf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "摩耶重炮的“出道战”\n终于到来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f13cc169a3530ab40fe364e81f08048c4777afb0df66779c697afe0dabc12be3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6336040b033aba4a6e22fa8e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "摩耶重炮一再提醒\n要训练员别错过她闪闪发亮的样子，\n并前往参加出道战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "067678aef57f3498ddc0fe5368f3c54fc4ed2bd9163ee5af6ef82409b06fee9e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69f4e6978688aa51269e817a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向出道战",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ea754365577b70c3247fb413fa7b90388e1e4a185a1da5f6c50ef25fe13c496",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec41584d9b2c342508eb4faa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "期待已久的“菊花赏”当天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae38691c88e04569a4c941eaf24404dea5f69914af1e758d6ffcaf79fa9a9a20",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c312db3bae8ee44366361d22",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "摩耶重炮表示要拿出最棒的表现，\n掳获训练员的心──",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8332bfc408321370f31de39bbaa6c0c264313ae321b0f8c6856162f19951b11",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa486fdd46e3631f1138be7d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "并朝着盛大舞台，\n精神百倍地冲了出去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "52279e27d4d3239993c5455573a916228d95be5b5712f777cbd892f2acbf869e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cf03065385ddac26e9daea2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向菊花赏",
      "source_fingerprint": "c32fe703b345a297a6972e4f3115aec53ea8a9931382257ccb6b146928c5537e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024409.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0d94a07d13728ef555c18c8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "到了“有马纪念”的比赛当天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4714ea6d64b34016b39ac7f3828dcab097a59ee19c2572198d3a1dbd416e4cd0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18eb0d75e5fecf3d8fbfe1c1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在“三冠赛马娘”成田白仁与\n“女杰”菱亚马逊的激烈交锋下──",
      "source_fingerprint": "dec44d5e851a2ad30b5bc38f8ccbb7e0a316d086407d84521c12184e37b54a68",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3036874f44f0cf0a4bd299c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "摩耶重炮表示自己并不打算输给她们，\n并充满自信地上场比赛了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "009b80df7d44102d143cfd751cd5fdefc95259ed944d751c2dbaad6f348df555",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55212f3a36c307216e1d554c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向有马纪念",
      "source_fingerprint": "a28480a57275928fde3ca335c4e37d5670b04bf8228df0e3cc61294de9b176ed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2f7a225803ed501d871296e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "历经严格的训练后，\n到了“阪神大赏典”当天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6659f6f8c1581e65ec7748f22fc93c13e408fe78ffd0f8a7581fae848d30e569",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024411.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:304d7854730f70bf8928d0dc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "摩耶重炮引擎全开冲了出去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f058042b2bf4d0113a27cc9689346287cdb7d93d257b8634e200d41bc653b75",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024411.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31b773fe5f3ea0fe3ec70bed",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "接着在比赛开始前，\n摩耶重炮找到成田白仁后，\n表示要堂堂正正地拿出全力向她挑战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d83caaf5d45ac2ff4a9e2d788a405fa239798e1f5f49cee063a4676270437aac",
