      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即使面对盛大舞台，\n摩耶重炮也没有感到紧张，\n一如往常地开心上场比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae9a432f31725a9cf8c176a1bd4587abdbf3a4e2d311d3dbce770accba68d9ea",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
