    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7adb04b54c1cf94ad9d9844",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "摩耶重炮鼓起了干劲，\n要在成田白仁没有参赛的这场比赛\n进一步成长，并上场比赛了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cffd80c8de4f520fe124bbb37f486f915006fce2bb353bc749ba241980ad310",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
