      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "成田白仁悄悄地关注着摩耶重炮。\n在她的观战下……\n“宝冢纪念”开赛了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "21f28d18730c37f310b71b408ac186627d66824d12c279a19f13634c89bf61e4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
