    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8535db7f9a8f6b87ec603f8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "跟以前相比成长了许多的摩耶重炮，\n依然追逐着想要“闪闪发亮”\n这个未曾改变的梦想──",
      "source_fingerprint": "810c1a8fe9c02b5a91a131befa19f46522260d03083441e0a0d5b1c657ac9fd4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bf2113271d4c87facb5432d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是她奔向了\n成田白仁在等着的那场比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9a7ce3a4ab5629f53644d923988c0752e1277abdc3b9afd1bd483ffd69a89aa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024415.json",
      "json_path": [
