      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她发下豪语说自己已经变得很强，\n会跑出比成田白仁更令人兴奋的表现，\n态度充满了自信。",
      "source_fingerprint": "43400867160eae28652f3fb6fafbaef7dc5e066b8d3b9d96129ce7823b3722ea",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
