    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2f74b6b3a70a3a28725f1d5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而为了证明自己讲的话，\n她决定要挑战成田白仁当初选择的\n三冠路线比赛“菊花赏”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e0da3c344abe7ce2fa6cb7b2626b15a8d112dc7b95a724d6ff0e714f07b33c0",
