    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e6f71164510681c780b6cb6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在访问途中，\n摩耶重炮谈到自己很关注成田白仁。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bbf207949379b562758aa9424e1b8aa1ee78f620699c996e920488e32d0f1b3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:274f7f9d9e5d8e37668ca731",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "乙名史记者向她询问，\n是否有意参加成田白仁接下来\n会出场的比赛……“有马纪念”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f5261064198d29dd3926ac34395a874bb38f7ff7d3fb1343cf64fb752238d82",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3130777c2d68d1749ab3f29a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了和成田白仁直接对决，\n摩耶重炮表示自己当然会参赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "57e62c8506e52c0b9645249a5eedef565f4244686d0ba222be4c6843f1aa9886",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1024/storytimeline_501024418.json",
      "json_path": [
