      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了再次和她来场令人兴奋的对决，\n摩耶重炮下定决心参加“阪神大赏典”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6cd90eebc0b22dfd8a554625bab9f7f02fca39a53fe894ba8d56901a34f3c56",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
