      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "摩耶重炮跑赢了成田白仁。\n但却在赛后，\n看见对方不满的样子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "20c38a59d5a68539c5ff1acffd1fd4d78cf0b78d44fd24f0e2782bd8cc698ec2",
