      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看见成田白仁若无其事地离开，\n摩耶重炮燃起了斗志，\n不想就这样输下去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6903a1cfa61ccd4772f9e89d04964bac8439f89f26ee824795efc5695b9fbda",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
